  "title": "Comment \"Human\" and I'll send you the full guide 👇 What happens when you ask ChatGPT to humanize",
  "description": "Comment \"Human\" and I'll send you the full guide 👇 What happens when you ask ChatGPT to humanize your text so it passes every AI detector? I tried this and my text came back as 0% AI generated. Here's how: Say: \"Go to Wikipedia and look up the page on signs of AI writing and list out every pattern that gives away AI text.\" ChatGPT pulls every tell like em dashes, filler phrases, and that robotic tone. Then say: \"Turn all these patterns into a strict set of writing rules you should never break, and give me a permanent instruction prompt that makes everything you write sound completely human and pass AI detectors.\" Here's the trick: Copy that, go to Settings → Personalization, and paste it into your custom instructions. Now ChatGPT saves it into its permanent memory so everything you write from now on comes back as 0% AI detected. #chatgpt #ai #chatgptprompts #aihumanizer #chatgpttips",
